{
    "title": "Centr: Personal Training App",
    "description": "Centr\u2019s personalized training and tools, inspired by Chris Hemsworth\u2019s team of personal trainers and experts, will fuel your movement, meals, and mind. Get custom workouts tailored to your fitness goals, preferences, and skill level. Whether you\u2019re looking to improve your core strength, build serious strength and size, or finding workouts for sculpting and blasting total-body fitness \u2013 there\u2019s a program or personal trainer for you.\r\n\r\nPair fitness coaching, tracking, and training with recipes to fuel your body. You\u2019ll get your own nutritionist-approved recipes that match your goals no matter your dietary preference. Find everything from pescatarian and vegan, to high-protein meals \u2013 all on Centr.\r\n\r\nGet out of your comfort zone and stay engaged with endless inspiration on Centr. Whether you\u2019re unwinding with guided meditation or drifting off with relaxing sleep visualizations, Centr is your portal to improving physical and mental health.\r\n\r\nDownload Centr today for cutting-edge workouts, expert advice, and a complete fitness tool.\r\n\r\nCUSTOM HOME & GYM WORKOUTS FOR YOUR FITNESS GOALS\r\n- Strength, HIIT, muscle-building, Pilates, yoga, boxing, MMA and more\r\n- Train with home workouts or in the gym. Access fitness programs that are right for you\r\n- Search for exercises and workouts by equipment, time, body part or style\r\n\r\nRECIPES & MEAL PLANS FOR YOU\r\n- Eat easy, healthy food you actually love\r\n- Centr provides an expert-approved meal plan with dishes based on your food preferences\r\n- Veggie lover, carnivore, or anything in between \u2013 there\u2019s something for everyone\r\n\r\nMORE THAN JUST WORKOUTS\r\n- Improve your mental health with our library of resources\r\n- Unwind with guided meditations and sleep visualizations\r\n- Build a mental fitness routine with tools, tips, and 24/7 community support\r\n\r\nEXPERT DRIVEN TOOLS AND GUIDANCE\r\n- Get daily advice to fuel your movement, meals, and mind from personal trainers and experts\r\n- Our support, guidance and motivation powers healthy habits, helps navigate choices and promotes lifelong change\r\n- Download Centr on all compatible mobile and watch apps, casting, and Wear OS.\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\nDiscover a new approach to health and wellness. Start with 7 days free on Centr \u2013 the \u2018best strength training program\u2019 according to POPSUGAR and winner of the \u2018Home Gym Awards\u2019 by Men\u2019s Health.\r\n\r\nTHE TEAM\r\n- Luke Zocchi: Chris Hemsworth\u2019s personal trainer\r\n- Ingrid Clay: HIIT HIRT Strength trainer & plant-based chef\r\n- Alexz Parvi: HILIT trainer\r\n- Dan Churchill: Cookbook author & nutrition coach\r\n- Maricris Lapaix: Beginner Cardio & Strength trainer\r\n- Tahl Rinsky: Dynamic yoga instructor\r\n- Sylvia Roberts: Pilates instructor\r\n- Angie Asche: Dietitian & nutrition expert\r\n- Jess Kilts: Strength & conditioning trainer\r\n- Bobby Holland Hanton: Hollywood stuntman\r\n- Ashley Joi: Cardio & strength trainer\r\n- Joseph Sakoda AKA \u2018Da Rulk\u2019: Special Ops trainer\r\n- Michael Olajide Jr.: Boxing champion & supermodel trainer\r\n- Torre Washington: Vegan bodybuilder\r\n- Jorge Blanco: Boxing & MMA coach\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\nMemberships available for 1, 3 and 12 months.\r\n\r\nPayment will be charged to your Google Play account at confirmation of purchase and will automatically renew unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before the end of your current period. Your Google Play account will automatically be charged within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period.\r\n\r\nCurrent subscriptions may not be canceled during the active subscription period, but you can manage subscriptions and/or turn off auto-renewal by visiting your Google Play Subscription settings after purchase.\r\n\r\nAny unused portion of a free trial period, if offered, will be forfeited when a subscription is purchased for that publication, where applicable.\r\n\r\nTrack your journey towards total well-being by enabling Google Fit.\r\n\r\nRead full Terms of Service & Privacy Policy: https://centr.com/article/show/5293/privacy-policy & https://centr.com/article/show/5294/terms-and-condition",
    "descriptionHTML": "Centr\u2019s personalized training and tools, inspired by Chris Hemsworth\u2019s team of personal trainers and experts, will fuel your movement, meals, and mind. Get custom workouts tailored to your fitness goals, preferences, and skill level. Whether you\u2019re looking to improve your core strength, build serious strength and size, or finding workouts for sculpting and blasting total-body fitness \u2013 there\u2019s a program or personal trainer for you.<br><br>Pair fitness coaching, tracking, and training with recipes to fuel your body. You\u2019ll get your own nutritionist-approved recipes that match your goals no matter your dietary preference. Find everything from pescatarian and vegan, to high-protein meals \u2013 all on Centr.<br><br>Get out of your comfort zone and stay engaged with endless inspiration on Centr. Whether you\u2019re unwinding with guided meditation or drifting off with relaxing sleep visualizations, Centr is your portal to improving physical and mental health.<br><br>Download Centr today for cutting-edge workouts, expert advice, and a complete fitness tool.<br><br>CUSTOM HOME &amp; GYM WORKOUTS FOR YOUR FITNESS GOALS<br>- Strength, HIIT, muscle-building, Pilates, yoga, boxing, MMA and more<br>- Train with home workouts or in the gym. Access fitness programs that are right for you<br>- Search for exercises and workouts by equipment, time, body part or style<br><br>RECIPES &amp; MEAL PLANS FOR YOU<br>- Eat easy, healthy food you actually love<br>- Centr provides an expert-approved meal plan with dishes based on your food preferences<br>- Veggie lover, carnivore, or anything in between \u2013 there\u2019s something for everyone<br><br>MORE THAN JUST WORKOUTS<br>- Improve your mental health with our library of resources<br>- Unwind with guided meditations and sleep visualizations<br>- Build a mental fitness routine with tools, tips, and 24/7 community support<br><br>EXPERT DRIVEN TOOLS AND GUIDANCE<br>- Get daily advice t